      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MATCHBOX CYCLONE (2) could manage only seventh at Warragul last time but caught the eye when posting a superb 24.30 over 435m at Sale three starts back. Can measure up again if runs up to recent best times. DIRTY APOLLO (5) flew the lids with a slick early split last time and went on to clock 22.28 as a strongly fancied winner over 390m at Shepparton. Should be in this for a long way. FURIOUS FALCON (7) jumped from this box last time and placed in a Grade 4/5 at this track over 425m, finishing third (24.22). Has a very consistent record off this same box, including two wins and three placings from six starts. Harder here but expected to feature again. ASTON JOPLIN (1) is worth a look despite no experience at this circuit.",
